Right now I'm learning German in hopes of moving and prospering there in 
the future. For the longest time, though, I've also wanted to learn Lojban 
out of sheer love for the principles on which it was created. Today I was 
extremely pleased to see that Duolingo <http://duolingo.com>, a language 
learning software company of which I'm a big fan, is implementing something 
I've been hoping for: the Duolingo Lanuage Incubator<http://www.duolingo.com/comment/868354>! 
When this feature is fully released, I'd love to participate by trying to 
simultaneously learn Lojban via the community documentation, while clumsily 
developing Duolingo for Lojban, for one consistent session every 1-2 weeks. 
Anyone wish to join/assist me? 

Thanks!
Dave J Dages
dichdesign.com

